From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:42:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bus: simple-pm-bus: Add apple,t8132-pmgr

The T8132 PMGR nodes are "apple,t8132-pmgr", "apple,t8103-pmgr", "syscon",
"simple-mfd". Their best match here is "apple,t8103-pmgr" (ONLY_BUS),
which is not their first compatible, so probe returns -ENODEV and both
nodes stay unbound.

The power domains in the mini PMGR take parents from the main PMGR, and
fw_devlink keeps waiting for the unbound mini PMGR node as a consumer of
those parents. On J713 this holds back the ATC common domains:

  sync_state() pending due to 388280000.power-management

genpd keeps a domain on until its provider's sync_state(), so these never
power down.

Bind the T8132 PMGRs as plain buses, like the other Apple PMGRs. With
sync_state() reached, genpd may switch off any unused domain the board
does not keep on. On J713 the two ATC common domains were the only ones
pending; the other T8132 boards were not tested.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>

(cherry picked from commit 8f687be747eb1dd1a5ae28032c49042b5d65dc8c)
[j604: the missing dependency of the idle USB-C port series (1c79b03209,
 4cacc48c78, cf4eb7c2e3) that 1.608 carries: on the J604 (1.608 boot
 fa2b5735) all three PHYs and dwc3 runtime-suspend and atc{0,1,3}_usb are
 off, but atc{0,1,3}_common stay on with no device and no powered subdomain.
 The J604 DTB has the same cross-bank parents (atcN_usb in pmgr_mini,
 atcN_common in pmgr); the unbound pmgr_mini device is a SYNC_STATE_ONLY
 consumer of each common domain, which keeps genpd stay_on set and is also
 counted by the DEFER_OFF absent-consumer check. A DTB walk finds exactly
 atc0/1/3_common held this way on the J604 (linux-aurora 1.608 and later).]
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 drivers/bus/simple-pm-bus.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/bus/simple-pm-bus.c b/drivers/bus/simple-pm-bus.c
index 6d351ca51a..9a8b654fe0 100644
--- a/drivers/bus/simple-pm-bus.c
+++ b/drivers/bus/simple-pm-bus.c
@@ -149,6 +149,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id simple_pm_bus_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8015-pmgr",	.data = ONLY_BUS },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8103-pmgr",	.data = ONLY_BUS },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8112-pmgr",	.data = ONLY_BUS },
+	{ .compatible = "apple,t8132-pmgr",	.data = ONLY_BUS },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t6000-pmgr",	.data = ONLY_BUS },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t6020-pmgr",	.data = ONLY_BUS },\
 	{ .compatible = "fsl,ls1021a-scfg", },
